Q1.
Predict the output.  // Fields are resolved based on Reference type

Code:
class A {
    int x = 10;
}

class B extends A {
    int x = 20;
}

// inside main
A a = new B();

System.out.println(a.x + " " + ((B) a).x);

A. 10 20
B. 20 20
C. 10 10
D. 20 10 

OUTPUT : A


